Platforms ai tasks that can be delegated
title end

paragraph start
Tasks that suit AI: drafting, formatting, summarising public sources so a person can read the source, and reminders. Tasks that stay with a person: choices that commit money or identity, publishing, and any statement of what a platform rule says.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Delegate only a task with a clear input, a clear output and a check a person can do quickly.
paragraph end

code start
language: text
task, delegate or keep, input, output, check
code end

paragraph start
todo: confirm the list and add tasks as they appear
Open until the owner decides.
